  "glyx.notes": {
    "note:scratch": "# release 1.4\ngit tag v1.4.0 && git push --tags\nnpm run build:release\ngh release create v1.4.0 --generate-notes\n\n# idea\ncache parsed feeds per ETag, skip\nthe parse when the server says 304",
    "note:study": "Present perfect or past simple?\n• I have lived here for three years. (still true)\n• I lived in Hue in 2019. (a finished time)\n\nPhrasal verbs this week\nlook up · give up · run out of · get along with",
    "note:runbook": "# update the stack\nssh nas\ncd /srv/compose\ndocker compose pull\ndocker compose up -d\n\n# immich is slow\ndocker logs immich_server --tail 50",
    "note:journal": "Monday, a slow one.\n\nThe rain kept on all afternoon; finished the draft anyway.\nLunch with Minh, who is moving to Đà Nẵng in spring.\n\nGrateful for: hot tea, a quiet evening, the playlist Linh sent.",
    "note:prompts": "# review\nReview this diff for bugs only.\nRank by severity, cite file:line.\n\n# commit\nWrite the commit message from the\nstaged diff: what changed and why.\n\n# explain\nExplain this like I know the\nlanguage but not the codebase.",
    "note:mamco": "Mâm cỗ chiều 30\n• Bánh chưng, giò lụa\n• Gà luộc lá chanh\n• Canh măng móng giò\n• Nem rán, xôi gấc\n• Dưa hành, chè kho\n\nMâm ngũ quả: phật thủ, bưởi, chuối,\nquýt, hồng xiêm",
    "note:one-on-ones": "# Minh\n• wants to own the checkout rewrite\n• promotion packet: two more examples\n• next: pair on the webhook retries\n\n# Hoa\n• on-call was heavy, swap next week\n• interested in the platform team",
    "note:minutes": "Họp giao ban sáng thứ Sáu\n\n1. Doanh số tháng 11 đạt 92% kế hoạch, thiếu ở\n   kênh online. Chị Lan đề xuất chạy khuyến mãi\n   cuối năm từ 15/12.\n2. Hợp đồng Sakura Retail: gửi báo giá trước 17h.\n3. Tiệc tất niên: chốt nhà hàng trước 10/12.\n\nViệc tiếp: Minh làm báo giá, Hoa chốt nhà hàng."
  },
